-summary field-type-string-long field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\n  \n            \u003Cp\u003EBelow lists some useful programs for data reduction, search matching, analysis and structure visualisation of diffraction data.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n\n\u003C\/article\u003E\n\n\n  \u003Carticle data-layout-label=\u0022Teaser\u0022 class=\u0022teaser\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-field-hero-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\n  \n              \u003Cimg loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 src=\u0022\/sites\/default\/files\/styles\/thumbnail\/public\/hero-images\/Australian%20Synchroton%20%286%29_0.jpg?itok=_UXb-5fO\u0022 width=\u0022114\u0022 height=\u002235\u0022 alt=\u0022User beam schedule\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\n\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022\/user-beam-schedule\u0022 hreflang=\u0022en\u0022\u003EUser beam schedule\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/h2\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-field-summary field-type-string-long field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\n  \n            \u003Cp\u003EThe schedule for the Australian Synchrotron includes time for shut-down for maintenance and upgrade of the storage ring and beamlines, and operational beamtime.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n\n\u003C\/article\u003E\n\n\n  \u003Carticle data-layout-label=\u0022Teaser\u0022 class=\u0022teaser\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022\/news\/a-landmark-year-and-bright-future-at-australian-synchrotron\u0022 hreflang=\u0022en\u0022\u003EA landmark year and bright future at the Australian Synchrotron\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/h2\u003E\n\u003C\/article\u003E\n\n\n  \u003Carticle class=\u0022teaser\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-field-media-file field-type-file field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\n  \n            \u003Ca href=\u0022\/media\/7360\/download?inline\u0022 type=\u0022application\/pdf; length=57987\u0022 title=\u0022Program_v1.pdf\u0022 class=\u0022file file--mime-application-pdf file--applica